{
  "id": 2626659,
  "title": "Thermoformed Apple  | Teacher Appreciation Gift",
  "coverUrl": "https://makerworld.bblmw.com/makerworld/model/US58554a31ea5504/design/1a648bd90b228515.jpg",
  "summary": "<boostme><boosttitle>Boost Me</boosttitle><boostcontent>If you like functional gift designs like this, a boost really helps 🙌<br>Got more “fillable” designs coming soon.</boostcontent></boostme><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A fresh take on the classic teacher apple—this <strong>thermoformed apple doubles as a lightweight container</strong>, perfect for small gifts.</p><p>The mesh-style thermoformed shell gives it a unique look while still allowing you to <strong>hold sweets, notes, or small surprises inside</strong>, making it ideal for thoughtful gifting.</p><p>Designed with <strong>Teacher Appreciation Week</strong> in mind, this piece blends symbolism with functionality—something simple, but meaningful.</p><h3>🎁 Why it works:</h3><ul><li>🍬 Holds candy, chocolates, or small gifts</li><li>📝 Perfect for handwritten notes</li><li>🍎 Recognizable teacher-themed design</li><li>✨ Unique thermoformed mesh aesthetic</li></ul><h2><strong>Use Ideas</strong></h2><ul><li>Fill with candy and gift it directly</li><li>Add a thank-you note inside</li><li>Bundle with other small presents</li><li>Classroom giveaways or desk gifts</li></ul><h2><strong>Print &amp; Thermoforming Notes</strong></h2><ul><li>Mesh design prints fast and forms easily</li><li>Use even heat to preserve structure</li><li>Works great in PLA</li><li>Optional: pair with a solid base (like shown) for stability</li></ul>",
